('game-3', 'gaming', 'IGNIS Gaming', 'digital', 'CRIMSON VENGEANCE: Retribution', 'Scarlet Blade Entertainment', 34.99, 59.99, 42, 4.9, 31200, 'Action', '["PC","PS5","Xbox Series X","Nintendo Switch"]'::jsonb, 'https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601150/ss_4410bada2565843dae693b03ac3a50256ff5dd66.1920x1080.jpg', 'https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/601150/ss_4ce180ed8979a51c72de51f985e9e9ba13500508.1920x1080.jpg', '["Hack and Slash","Fast-Paced","Singleplayer","Stylized","Soundtrack"]'::jsonb, '["Ultra responsive 120 FPS combat engine with sub-frame cancel windows","Dynamic style gauge ranking from D to SSS with adaptive battle tracks","Bloodmorph arsenal allowing 14 different weapon fusion combinations","Bloody Palace survival mode with 101 escalating monster floors"]'::jsonb, 'Channel demonic bloodlust as Dante Vance, the last Crimson Knight. Chain 100-hit aerial combos, switch between scythe, twin odachi, and railguns in millisecond intervals.'),
